{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/posts/vue/12_custom_event/","result":{"data":{"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<p>자식 컴포넌트에서 props를 수정하고 싶으면  custom event를 사용한다.<br>\n자식 컴포넌트에서 부모 컴포넌트로 메세지를 보내<br>\n부모 컴포넌트에 있는 데이터를 수정해야 한다.</p>\n<p>자식 컴포넌트에서 부모 컴포넌트로 메시지를 보내고,<br>\n부모 컴포넌트에서 메시지를 수신해야 한다.</p>\n<h2 id=\"emit작명-데이터\" style=\"position:relative;\">$emit(‘작명’, 데이터)<a href=\"#emit%EC%9E%91%EB%AA%85-%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%84%B0\" aria-label=\"emit작명 데이터 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>자식 컴포넌트에서 부모 컴포넌트로 메세지를 보내는 문법</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"vue\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-vue line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-vue\">&lt;!-- &lt;h4 @click=&quot;$emit(&#39;작명&#39;, 데이터)&quot;&gt;{{ 원룸.title }}&lt;/h4&gt; --&gt;\r\n&lt;h4 @click=&quot;$emit(&#39;openModal&#39;, 원룸.id)&quot;&gt;{{ 원룸.title }}&lt;/h4&gt;</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"작명script\" style=\"position:relative;\">@작명=“script”<a href=\"#%EC%9E%91%EB%AA%85script\" aria-label=\"작명script permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>부모 컴포넌트에서 메시지를 수신하는 문법</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"vue\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-vue line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-vue\">&lt;!-- &lt;ProductCard @openModal=&quot;모달창열렸니=1&quot; v-for=&quot;(a,i) in 원룸들&quot; :key=&quot;i&quot; :원룸=&quot;원룸들[i]&quot; /&gt; --&gt;\r\n&lt;ProductCard @openModal=&quot;모달창열렸니=1; 누른거=$event;&quot; v-for=&quot;(a,i) in 원룸들&quot; :key=&quot;i&quot; :원룸=&quot;원룸들[i]&quot; /&gt;</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"함수사용하기\" style=\"position:relative;\">함수사용하기<a href=\"#%ED%95%A8%EC%88%98%EC%82%AC%EC%9A%A9%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0\" aria-label=\"함수사용하기 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>ProductCard.vue</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"vue\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-vue line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-vue\">&lt;template&gt;\r\n  &lt;div&gt;\r\n    &lt;img :src=&quot;원룸.image&quot; class=&quot;room-img&quot;&gt;\r\n    &lt;h4 @click=&quot;함수&quot;&gt;{{ 원룸.title }}&lt;/h4&gt;\r\n    &lt;p&gt;{{ 원룸.content }}&lt;/p&gt;\r\n    &lt;p&gt;{{ 원룸.price }}원&lt;/p&gt;\r\n  &lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/template&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;script&gt;\r\nexport default {\r\n  name: &#39;ProductCard&#39;,\r\n  props: {\r\n    원룸: Object,\r\n  },\r\n  methods: {\r\n    함수(){\r\n      this.$emit(&#39;openModal&#39;, this.원룸.id);\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n&lt;/script&gt;</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"모달창-닫기\" style=\"position:relative;\">모달창 닫기<a href=\"#%EB%AA%A8%EB%8B%AC%EC%B0%BD-%EB%8B%AB%EA%B8%B0\" aria-label=\"모달창 닫기 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>ModalDetail.vue</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"vue\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-vue line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-vue\">&lt;template&gt;\r\n  &lt;div class=&quot;black-bg&quot; v-if=&quot;모달창열렸니==1&quot;&gt;\r\n    &lt;div class=&quot;white-bg&quot;&gt;\r\n      &lt;img :src=&quot;원룸들[누른거].image&quot; class=&quot;room-img&quot;&gt;\r\n      &lt;h4&gt;{{ 원룸들[누른거].title }}&lt;/h4&gt;\r\n      &lt;p&gt;{{ 원룸들[누른거].content }}&lt;/p&gt;\r\n      &lt;p&gt;{{ 원룸들[누른거].price }}&lt;/p&gt;\r\n      &lt;button @click=&quot;closeModal&quot;&gt;닫기&lt;/button&gt;\r\n    &lt;/div&gt;\r\n  &lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/template&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;script&gt;\r\nexport default {\r\n  name: &#39;ModalDetail&#39;,\r\n  props: {\r\n    원룸들: Object, // Number, String, Array\r\n    누른거: Number,\r\n    모달창열렸니: Number,\r\n  },\r\n  methods: {\r\n    closeModal(){\r\n      this.$emit(&#39;closeModal&#39;);\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n&lt;/script&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;style&gt;\r\n/* modal */\r\n.black-bg{position:fixed; padding:20px; width:100%; height:100%; background:rgba(0,0,0, 0.5);}\r\n.white-bg{width:100%; background:#fff; border-radius:8px; padding:20px;}\r\n&lt;/style&gt;</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p>App.vue</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"text\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-text line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-text\">&lt;ModalDetail :원룸들=\"원룸들\" :누른거=\"누른거\" :모달창열렸니=\"모달창열렸니\" @closeModal=\"모달창열렸니=0;\" /></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span></span></pre></div>","tableOfContents":"<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#emit%EC%9E%91%EB%AA%85-%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%84%B0\">$emit(‘작명’, 데이터)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#%EC%9E%91%EB%AA%85script\">@작명=“script”</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#%ED%95%A8%EC%88%98%EC%82%AC%EC%9A%A9%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0\">함수사용하기</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#%EB%AA%A8%EB%8B%AC%EC%B0%BD-%EB%8B%AB%EA%B8%B0\">모달창 닫기</a></li>\